WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:06.240
February of the 24th year of Yuankang beishuo Army marched south advancing triumphantly.

00:06.320 --> 00:11.920
After capturing Yuzhou split into two routes zhu Yuanzhi led one route to attack Huaicheng.

00:12.120 --> 00:16.120
Sikong Yao and Xie Xuan led the main force to attack Dongming.

00:26.360 --> 00:31.160
Brother-in-law the local governor is named Cao Biaozhi I heard this person.

00:31.240 --> 00:34.080
Once risked himself to help you, brother-in-law.

00:37.200 --> 00:42.040
Ministry of Revenue Vice Minister Cao Biaozhi this person is upright in such matters.

00:42.120 --> 00:44.040
He can distinguish loyalty from treachery.

00:45.040 --> 00:49.960
It was the Chen family's daughter who gave evidence of the Chen family's embezzlement to His Majesty.

